    which draws a UUID: there is no oracle for a random value, and claiming
    one would be the failure this file exists to avoid."
   :cost
   "A shift COUNT must be an integer literal in [0,63], so the nibble at a
    loop position cannot be reached by shifting. Probe:
    q9-probes/p20-shift-count.kotoba. The component divides by 16 i times
    instead, after masking the sign bit so quot's truncation agrees with a
    logical shift."}
  :as-int
  {:status :ported
